5,0,1,talk,Jonathan,,"Good evening, everyone. Let us try to find the werewolf through calm discussion.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Mizuki,,I agree. Logic will be our best tool here. I'll be observing everyone's reactions closely.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Rin,,This is so exciting! I'm going to find the bad guy first!,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Misaki,,I'll do my best to help. Let's just stay focused.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Benjamin,,A delightful start. I look forward to seeing how our collective reasoning unfolds.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Jonathan,,Does anyone have any initial theories or a strategy they'd like to propose?,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Mizuki,,Not yet. It's too early for theories. We need more data from the conversation.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Rin,,"@Mizuki, you're always so serious! Maybe the werewolf is just hiding in plain sight!","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
