31,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,I have information. Mizuki is the werewolf.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,"What? That's a bold lie. Jonathan, are you trying to frame me immediately?","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Rin,,Whoa! We found them already? Is it really Mizuki?,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Misaki,,"That was fast. Jonathan, are you the Seer?","{""words"":8,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"My, what a dramatic opening. A direct accusation on the first day is quite a gamble.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"Yes, I am the Seer. I divined Mizuki last night, and the result was clear.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,"He's lying to gain trust. If I were the werewolf, would I be this surprised?","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Rin,,But Jonathan seems so honest! I believe him!,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Misaki,,It's possible he's the werewolf trying to eliminate a threat.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Misaki makes a fair point. However, the Seer's claim is very specific.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,I have no reason to lie. The village should act now while we have a lead.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,Mizuki,,"If you execute me, you're losing a logical ally. Jonathan is the one manipulating us.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Rin,,"I don't like it when people fight, but the Seer says so!","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Misaki,,"I'm torn, but the Seer's role is too valuable to ignore if he's telling the truth.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,"It would be a shame to execute an innocent, but logic suggests following the Seer's lead.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
